╍╍╍╍ Miami26 ╍╍╍╍

Fork of Nashville96 (by donfaustinocortizone) with gtk4 code nabbed from Redmond97-SE (by Silver_X) for GTK 4 support. I adjusted some of the colors along with redoing the color definitions. I only tested this on Linux Mint MATE, I cannot guaranteed that this'll work on other DEs.
I'm still learning gtk css so updates will not be frequent.

I don't know how to add hdpi support, so I cannot update those.

